Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.35,0:22:17.19,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}ねぇ 部屋にこない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.35,0:22:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}呐 不来房里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.76,0:22:25.11,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}ナイショのハナシ 聞かせてあげる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.76,0:22:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}有悄悄话 想对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.31,0:22:34.21,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}ふらちな夜に心も濡れた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.31,0:22:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}无情之夜 心已湿透
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.79,0:22:37.76,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}時はもどせない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.79,0:22:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}机不可失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.01,0:22:40.22,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}Come back  Come back Come back
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.01,0:22:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}回来 来吧 快来
